556	 * Opt-in + inert: no-op unless hostingWildcardEnabled() AND a Cloudflare token is
557	 * present AND shared hosting is enabled AND not sandbox (ensureWildcardCert
558	 * re-checks all of these per node too). Runs on a ~daily cadence from the worker;
